{"id":"en_crown-in-blood-king-returns","title":"Crown in Blood, King Returns","titleEn":"Crown in Blood, King Returns","description":"A decade after witnessing his parents' murder, Kane has risen to the rank of S-Class Supergene Awakening. Rather than reveal his strength, he conceals it behind the guise of an ordinary weakling, using that disguise to draw near to Bla. His true purpose remains hidden as he moves carefully among those around him, waiting for the right moment to act on the vengeance that has driven him for ten years. The series follows this double life of quiet deception and gathering power, where every encounter carries the weight of a long-deferred reckoning. Viewers can follow the unfolding story on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/3633857bef2467ee/cs_CZ/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/3633857bef2467ee/cs_CZ/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Identity Twist","Revenge","Identity Twist","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlmea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_crown-in-blood-king-returns_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlmea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_crown-in-blood-king-returns_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlmea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_crown-in-blood-king-returns_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlmea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_crown-in-blood-king-returns_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"